# kitty-terminfo is absent from Arch POWER's base -- their build drops that
# split -- so we build pkgbase kitty ourselves (0.48.0 vs their 0.46.2) and
# get all three splits. Its deps are not in Arch POWER either:
# python-sphinx_design, shader-slang, unordered_dense, miniz.
