libusb-compat
# linux / linux-4k -- Arch POWER's 7.1.5 and 7.1.4. Replaced by our own
# 7.2.2, because the LIVE MEDIUM is where an EEH fence would hurt most: if
# PHB#30 fences while pacstrap is writing, 7.1 deadlocks eehd on
# pci_rescan_remove_lock and the install hangs with no recovery. 0006 fixes
# that and is only in our tree. Same 4K pages, same amdgpu=m.
